    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="466397e7-95d3-5b93-8383-28512c6e7804" activityNameId="991b959a-72f1-517e-a57c-bcf015bb6073" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sink, granite-acrylresin, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sink, granite-acrylresin, at plant
The sink has the dimensions 1000 x 190 x 500 mm and a weight of 14 kg. The final product is delivered with 5 kg packaging material, which is assumed to be corrugated board. The data are based on assupmtions and qualified estimates. Production takes place in Europe (Germany). The sink is transported 300 km to Switzerland. Energy consumption for mixing is estimated based on energy demand for the production of anhydrite floor and the energy use for hardening is based on manufacturer data.;
UUID: 0420cb3d-55b5-3306-b2ce-32e8a68dd2c1
This data set includes the materials and resources needed for producing one sink made from granite-acrylresin. The sink contains two basins of different size and a drainboard. The sink has the dimensions 1000 x 190 x 500 mm and a weight of 14 kg.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average processes for producing chromium steel products.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0420cb3d-55b5-3306-b2ce-32e8a68dd2c1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
